WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for the promo long cut (scenes S0–S8). Timings are the planned scene windows; demo:encode's promo target aligns them to the assembled cut.

s0
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Wolfpack — a self-hosted control room for coding agents.

s1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Every agent on every machine. The ones waiting for you float to the top.

s2
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Answer in one click — the banner replies for you.

s3
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Switch instantly. Resize live. Tile sessions side by side.

s4
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Agents spawn agents. See the whole tree.

s5
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:57.000
From your phone, over your tailnet. Install the PWA; get notified when an agent needs you.

s6
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Scriptable from any agent: spawn, send, wait, follow events — on any machine.

s7
